---
layout: base
title: Projects
description: 'One page per project -- whitepapers, source repos, and CAD.'
pagination:
  data: collections.allProjects
  size: 6
permalink: 'projects/{% if pagination.pageNumber >=1 %}page-{{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}/{% endif %}index.html'
---

<div class="wrapper">
  {#- Was a `spot-color-theme-secondary` band: #eaeaea text on the #9a9a9a
     grey surface, about 1.9:1 -- well under the 4.5:1 minimum, and the
     accessibility pass is a stated Phase 1 requirement. Now matches the
     Services/Contact header pattern on the normal near-black surface. #}
  <header class="region flow" style="--region-space-top: var(--space-xl-2xl); --region-space-bottom: var(--space-s)">
    <h1 class="font-display">{{ title }}</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="region flow prose" style="--region-space-top: var(--space-s); --region-space-bottom: var(--space-m)">
    <p>
      Build documentation for each project — whitepapers, source, and CAD where it exists. Flagship pieces carry an
      interactive 3D model.
    </p>
  </div>

  <custom-masonry layout="50-50">
    {% asyncEach item in pagination.items %}
      {% include "partials/card-project.njk" %}
    {% endeach %}
  </custom-masonry>

  {% set collectionToPaginate = collections.projects %}
  {% set metaKey = "projects" %}
  {% if collectionToPaginate.length > pagination.size %}
    {% include 'partials/pagination.njk' %}
  {% endif %}
</div>
